[thin] The selected water-regulator cap has 2 mm spring leaves and a 1.6 mm solid retaining nose with its 1 mm pointed lead-in. The reported 1.774 mm diagonal crosses the transition between these specified flexure and catch surfaces. Derek has physically approved this fitted section. The point and flexible catch are required features, rather than a bulk receiver wall.
alternatives: Increasing the spring thickness changes its accepted bending section. Blunting the nose removes the selected pointed lead-in. Increasing the hook height changes its mating roof pocket.
